why: The reader goes back to doing what the `awk` subset did -- cut a value at the first `#` -- and `output = "build/demo#1"` silently builds `build/demo`. It is the sharper of the two defects that replaced reader had, because the document was *accepted*: a wrong answer with a zero exit status and nothing to read.
--- old
